summary:
  An open window asks the sound server every two seconds whether or not anybody is at it.

history:
  Every tick of the level poll is a shell with two pactl, two grep, head
  and tr. A window is on screen all day, minimised or not, so "on screen"
  kept the poll at full rate beside other work: 1800 shells an hour. The
  rate goes by somebody being at the face.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          interval: playerWindow.faceWatched ? 2000 : 30000

replace:
          interval: playerWindow.faceShown ? 2000 : 30000

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_level_is_asked_at_full_rate_only_while_somebody_is_at_the_face.
  Line-neutral.
